<title>INDONESIA: TENNIS-ITALY LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALY LEAD INDONESIA 2-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy led Indonesia 2-0 after</p>
<p>the opening singles on the first day of their Fed Cup World</p>
<p>Group play-off tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Silvia Farina beat Wurikasih Sawondari 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Perfetti Flora beat Wynne Prakusya 6-3 6-7 (6-8) 6-1</p>
